hostlink: art pace 1 fps: every 1000 ms
hostlink: art pace 2 fps: every 500 ms
hostlink: art pace 3 fps: every 333 ms
hostlink: art pace 4 fps: every 250 ms
hostlink: art pace 5 fps: every 200 ms
