hostlink: art pace 8 fps: every 125 ms
hostlink: art pace 10 fps: every 100 ms
hostlink: art pace 12 fps: every 83 ms
hostlink: art pace 15 fps: every 66 ms
hostlink: art pace 24 fps: every 41 ms
hostlink: art pace 30 fps: every 33 ms
hostlink: art pace 60 fps: every 16 ms
hostlink: art pace as before (1000 / fps, animate off and on, stills still): yes
